Package: argosrc
Type: Package
Title: Automatic Review and Governance for Oncology Studies in REDCap
Version: 0.0.2.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Eduardo", "García-Galea", , "eduardogarcia@vhio.net", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4699-0786"))
Description: A companion to 'odytools' for automated data quality review of
    REDCap databases in clinical oncology research. Provides tools to assess
    completeness (missing and unexpected values respecting branching logic) and
    plausibility (cross-field consistency and temporal logic) across REDCap
    forms and events. Results can be exported as timestamped Excel reports
    suitable for inclusion in study monitoring workflows.
